WEBVTT

00:04:57.121 --> 00:05:02.954
I think, like, it's always easy to do
scroll and think about how bad are

00:05:03.079 --> 00:05:06.579
the bad things are, but the good things
are really good and getting much better.

00:05:07.371 --> 00:05:13.163
Is it your sincere belief that artificial
intelligence can actually make that

00:05:13.163 --> 00:05:14.204
future better?

00:05:15.121 --> 00:05:20.996
Certainly. How look, with any technology.
I don't think it will all be better.

00:05:20.996 --> 00:05:25.496
I think there are always positive and
negative use cases of anything new,

00:05:25.496 --> 00:05:27.746
and it's our job to maximize
the positive ones,

00:05:27.746 --> 00:05:28.913
minimize the negative ones.

00:05:28.913 --> 00:05:31.371
But I truly, genuinely believe that